{"stem_en": "Which limit is infinite (tends to ∞)?", "stem_bn": "কোনটি অসীম সীমা (∞-এর দিকে যায়)?", "option_a_en": "lim (x→0) (sin x)/x", "option_a_bn": "মান lim (x→0) (sin x)/x", "option_b_en": "lim (x→0) (1 − cos x)/x²", "option_b_bn": "মান lim (x→0) (1 − cos x)/x²", "option_c_en": "lim (x→0) 1/x²", "option_c_bn": "মান lim (x→0) 1/x²", "option_d_en": "lim (x→0) (e^x − 1)/x", "option_d_bn": "মান lim (x→0) (eˣ − 1)/x", "correct": "C", "difficulty": "easy", "type": "conceptual", "explanation_en": "As x → 0, 1/x² → +∞, while the other three limits are finite.", "explanation_bn": "x → 0 এ 1/x² → +∞; অন্য তিনটি সসীম সীমা।", "verified": false, "source": "Udvash HSC Question Bank 2026; licensed redistribution; higher_mathematics p1 ch09; curated bilingual"}
